display="inline"><![CDATA[\mathcal {C}]]></fr:tex>, a <fr:em>subobject classifier</fr:em> is an object <fr:tex
display="inline"><![CDATA[Ω]]></fr:tex> together
    with a global element <fr:tex
display="inline"><![CDATA[true : 1 → Ω]]></fr:tex> such that <fr:tex
display="inline"><![CDATA[∀ A ∈ \mathcal {C}. ∀ s : S ↣ A. ∃!     χ_s : A → Ω.]]></fr:tex>
    
    
    
        
        <fr:figure><fr:resource
