    generalized element of <fr:tex
display="inline"><![CDATA[A]]></fr:tex> is <fr:em>just</fr:em> an object of the slice over <fr:tex
display="inline"><![CDATA[A]]></fr:tex>.</fr:p><fr:p>There's supposed to be some Kripke-style interpretation of these as
    elements defined at points in time, but TODO.</fr:p><fr:p>From <fr:link
